Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.77,0:00:06.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's perfectly fine to get too into something or to laugh like an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:10.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And if anyone says otherwise, I'll beat them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:17.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Oh... she's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:19.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,All I wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.79,0:00:24.75,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...was to be able to live and laugh freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:28.25,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Someone to tell me it was okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.51,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...to have meaning in my life.
