Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.69,0:02:18.91,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've seen Kou so vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.41,0:02:26.41,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He's counting on me to support him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:33.84,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He's pretty cute when he's like this.{otonashikute ergo kawaii}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:37.80,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,This is my favorite scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:40.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:42.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.27,0:02:48.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:54.65,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:04.45,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Oh... he doesn't want me to see him cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.70,0:03:09.91,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,That must've been why he put his arms around me in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:13.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:16.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:28.35,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.18,0:03:34.81,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Half of me wants to support him in any way I can,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.81,0:03:41.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,but the other half just wants\N to look at his tear-stained face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.61,0:03:45.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:48.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You make one heck of a face when you run.{I sort of feel like this is metaphorical running though}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.29,0:03:52.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're so mean! How could you make fun of me when I was so desperately...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.25,0:03:57.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm not making fun of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.09,0:04:02.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You were actually kind of cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:05.80,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,By the light of the moon,{partially chosen because I feel more comfortable when there's a comma, and partially chosen because au clair de la lune}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:09.68,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou's eyelashes glimmered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:14.19,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,His face had been stained with tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.02,0:04:16.94,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I must be the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:20.15,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,to have ever seen him like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:22.74,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,The only one he'd show this to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:31.58,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Wait... isn't this the perfect time to confess?{also consider "perfect time to tell him my feelings?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:23.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou—
