Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.89,0:05:34.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's grab a bite and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.02,0:05:40.23,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Just like a couple! I feel bad for Yuuri, but I can't let this slip!{the foodgetting is couplelike; they're not couplelike yet}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:43.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:50.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I stopped by your house before I came, and Tanaka-sensei was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:55.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He probably made dinner and is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:04.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tanaka-sensei said something to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:07.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He thought you bore a grudge against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.05,0:06:14.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's because he wasn't able to be by your side when you needed him the most.{I know it doesn't match the previous episode, but this makes more sense}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.97,0:06:20.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh? We were living so far apart that it's not like there was anything he could've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.65,0:06:24.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:30.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I think you should tell him that yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:44.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:46.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:47.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:53.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.97,0:06:58.81,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}kudarizaka fumikiri made
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.97,0:06:58.81,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Before I knew it, I had run
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:57.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, see you at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.43,0:06:59.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yep, see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.81,0:07:03.81,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}atashi wa muchuu de hashitta
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.81,0:07:03.81,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}all the way down to the train tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.81,0:07:09.49,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}kono koi wo saegiru you ni
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.81,0:07:09.49,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}What I found was a train departing,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.23,0:07:05.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:14.37,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}densha wa sugisatta
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:14.37,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}taking my love with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.45,0:07:12.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:20.04,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}tooi hi no kioku  umi no kagayaki
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:20.04,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Distant memories, shining seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:16.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:22.92,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}kisetsu wa meguru
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:22.92,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Seasons pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:27.30,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}hikoukigumo ni me wo hosomete
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:27.30,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Now, I squint up at the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:32.68,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}chiisaku yureta himawari
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:32.68,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}A sunflower swayed in the breeze,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.55,0:07:32.26,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:39.06,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}sayonara mo ienai mata
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:39.06,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}seeing how I couldn't even say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.55,0:07:36.76,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou's door really opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:40.31,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,You've finally stepped outside, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:48.90,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}hon no suumiri no sukima de sotto kusuguru itami
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:48.90,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}We were so tantalizingly close, yet so far apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:44.61,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But even if you won't come out this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:49.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'll just kick that door down again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:54.45,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}manatsu ni kieta hanabi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:54.45,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}If only the summer fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:54.16,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'll kick it down any time you need me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:08:00.37,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}namida no saki ni utsureba
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:08:00.37,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}had appeared before my tears...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:05.79,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}I will kitto omoidasu wa
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:05.79,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}I will definitely remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:17.56,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}anata ni todoke kono basho de atashi wa matteiru
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:17.56,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Please know that I'll be here, waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:11.01,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,You desperately keep running to save me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:14.43,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,no matter how many times you fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fs14\fsp-1\bord0\yshad-0.7\xshad0.4\\fnArray\b1\c&H504436&\fax0.09\4c&H4D3D2E&\pos(536.8,288.4)\frz353.1}Mabuchi
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fs21\fsp-1\bord0\yshad-2\xshad1\fnArtificeSSK\b1\c&H504436&\fax0.09\4c&H4D3D2E&\frz354.7\pos(581.941,330.466)}Tanaka
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:42.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:44.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:50.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What about dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.92,0:08:52.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:07.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad. Welcome home. {hearing oyaji makes me want to use pops}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:09.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Youichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.69,0:09:11.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Came over again, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:22.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just a minute, Dad. I'm almost done...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:29.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm starving. Guess I'll eat tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:35.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Great! Kou, can you serve the rice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:40.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to get chopsticks for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.89,0:09:41.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:57.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:03.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:13.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.05,0:10:23.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,All right, help yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:25.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.02,0:10:27.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:27.56,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.95,0:10:42.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You know, I've waited so long for this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.12,0:10:50.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I wanted to keep smiling all the way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:53.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Guess I couldn't keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.46,0:11:00.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,After Mom died, I didn't know
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.68,0:11:03.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,whether coming back to this house alone
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:06.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,and eating together like this without her
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.27,0:11:08.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,was really okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:15.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I didn't know if it was okay to do all the things Mom wasn't able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.57,0:11:17.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I never knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:20.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:25.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Your mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:32.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She wasn't that uncaring a woman.
