Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:11.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Tonight's dinner is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.71,0:12:14.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.59,0:12:19.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We have plenty to go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:22.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You eat too, Kou. It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.43,0:12:27.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,About my family name...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.02,0:12:33.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Could I wait a while longer to change it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:38.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's not that I'm against being called Tanaka again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.61,0:12:40.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.70,0:12:46.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Changing your name in high school \Ncould cause quite a stir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.87,0:12:51.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,All right, I understand. {changing to match}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:55.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We can wait until after you sort your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.33,0:13:02.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Even if our names are different, we'll always be a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fs26\fsp-1\bord0\yshad-0.7\xshad0.4\fnArray\b1&\fax-0.12\4c&H4D3D2E&\frz6.824\pos(618.8,320.4)\3c&H6D5C4A&\c&H6D5C4A&}Mabuchi
