Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.23,0:13:19.02,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I guess Kou's not here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.44,0:13:25.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I got a little carried away last night and ended up doing some crazy things,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:30.99,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,but now that I have a chance to breathe, the embarrassment is catching up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.49,0:13:35.58,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Even if we consider what happened just a friend helping a friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:39.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,that doesn't mean it'll be any \Nless awkward to face him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.04,0:13:41.25,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What about Kou?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.17,0:13:45.42,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,How's he going to handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:53.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,M-Morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.81,0:14:01.82,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's just as flustered as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.11,0:14:06.07,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I guess that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.79,0:14:23.84,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What did he just do? It was so adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:26.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Did Kou always act like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:29.18,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Crap, I can't keep a straight face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:33.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Where were you yesterday?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:38.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you ditched us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.19,0:14:41.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me neither. Sorry about that.{"can't say I disagree" would make sense in response to "the way you ditsched us was so mean"}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:43.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You sure don't sound like you're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.78,0:14:46.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How about today? Are you free?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:50.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.78,0:14:54.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll do as much as I can. How's that sound? {it doesn't quite come across but he's referring back to Kominato saying he's not sincere}{I think it's gut genug}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.16,0:14:57.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Really? I'm free all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:15:01.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Damn, I'm think I'm gonna cry... just kidding. {...}{...}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.25,0:15:02.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:04.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.05,0:15:05.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:10.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You can count on us to keep \Nthose summer lessons at bay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.51,0:15:13.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Leave it all to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:44.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.50,0:15:47.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just my way of saying thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:49.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.38,0:15:54.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You all went out of your way to help me study,\N and I outscored every one of you.
