Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.39,0:15:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.80,0:15:58.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're pretty spiteful, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.35,0:16:01.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Man, I was {\i1}not{\i0} expecting this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.85,0:16:07.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we all got into the top section!\N\NIt's my first time ever! {I don't think it's common knowledge that being posted = good, and I'm sure other anime have everyone's names up}{Yeah, some schools post all the grades}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.65,0:16:09.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We didn't put in all that effort for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.94,0:16:11.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:17.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You can say that again. Now we can focus on making vacation plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:21.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's right! Nothing but good times ahead of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:23.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I always get shaky knees up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:27.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're right there, Touma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:28.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:30.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wow, I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.67,0:16:34.38,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It's the guy from the library!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:38.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The molester! {literally female pervert}{oh, how many times have I seen it translated as "female pervert"...}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:40.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wait, Touma?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:43.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, wasn't he—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:45.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Not a word! I'm ashamed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:51.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,A-Anyway, let the good times begin! It's summer! {I might be insane, but I think this exists? if not it should}{"clear skies" as a metaphor for "days without trouble" is a thing, but the way you have it formulated sounds like you've been corrupted by Aikatsu}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.53,0:16:54.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Summer is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.95,0:17:04.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I know you're excited for summer vacation, \Nbut don't get yourselves into too much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:05.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:10.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you free now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.71,0:17:12.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure, let's hang out somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:14.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We need to sort out our plans, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:15.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.97,0:17:17.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, what about...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.55,0:17:20.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wait, where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.51,0:17:23.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I just saw him leaving with his bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.27,0:17:23.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He's so quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.73,0:17:27.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And Kominato-kun is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.06,0:17:28.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And the AC was broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:31.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.36,0:17:33.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Alright, then let's go after Kou!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.78,0:17:35.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Futaba-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:38.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He probably hasn't left the building yet.{or you could translate it slightly literallier, I guess}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:44.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Shuuko!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.62,0:17:45.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Shuu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.21,0:17:48.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You two can go get Mabuchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.67,0:17:50.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:52.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We'll wait for you at the entrance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.80,0:18:00.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,They sure are lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.51,0:18:04.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Shuuko! Shuu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:10.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:13.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get serious this summer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.95,0:18:18.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,M-Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:21.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.91,0:18:27.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:28.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:31.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.96,0:18:33.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:40.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I think that's the first time I've heard someone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.51,0:18:43.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,call you by your first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.68,0:18:45.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.73,0:18:48.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just because I found a place to belong
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.15,0:18:53.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,doesn't mean that my feelings have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.61,0:19:00.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I bet you thought you were done with having to put up with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:06.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And what if I told you that I've never thought of it as "putting up with you"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.21,0:19:11.67,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He's not fair. I let down my guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:15.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Happy summer vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.51,0:19:20.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Holiday greetings already?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.35,0:19:28.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you're going to lead Murao on\N just to hurt her in the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:32.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go unpunished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.56,0:19:35.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:41.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So it's okay as long as I don't \Nend up hurting her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:46.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Happy summer vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:51.33,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}yuudachi nokotteru machi no naka
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:51.33,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}In a town beset by a sudden shower,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:50.83,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He pisses me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.25,0:19:54.79,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I like Kou, but his brother sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:56.71,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}sore ja mata ne to chiisaku furu yo
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:56.71,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}I say "See you later", and wave goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.04,0:19:57.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kominato-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.71,0:20:02.18,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}kaisatsu no saki me de oikakete
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.71,0:20:02.18,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}As I watch you pass through the ticket gate, I think:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.09,0:20:00.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, what're you all doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.43,0:20:04.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We're gonna hang out somewhere and talk about what to do over break.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.18,0:20:07.47,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}kitaidoori ni wa nakanaka ne
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.18,0:20:07.47,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}"It never goes according to plan, does it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.89,0:20:07.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a plan. Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.47,0:20:17.19,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}nanika ga kowarete shimaisou de
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.47,0:20:17.19,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Everything seemed incredibly fragile that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.18,0:20:11.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Seriously, couldn't we just\N set everything up over text?{I know it's kinda blurry but}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.77,0:20:13.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.81,0:20:16.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's way more fun to decide these things when we're all together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.98,0:20:19.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's spot on, Kou.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.19,0:20:22.78,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}mata kyou mo sugiteyuku
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.19,0:20:22.78,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}but it passed, as days tend to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.69,0:20:22.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Be a man and come.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.65,0:20:23.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.95,0:20:25.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So, you wanna do this at Nuts Donuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.95,0:20:33.33,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}reeru wa kimi wo hakondeyuku kara
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.95,0:20:33.33,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}The rails carry you away
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:29.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm stuck with them for the long haul. {yeah, I know he says "long-term course confirmed"}{thine is eek fine}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.33,0:20:31.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.83,0:20:33.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.33,0:20:41.59,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}itsumo onaji miakita kaerimichi
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.33,0:20:41.59,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}leaving me alone on our usual path.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:52.23,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}matometa kotoba tanjun na no ni na
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:52.23,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}The words I prepared for you are so simple,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:53.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,At first, I was alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.23,0:21:00.94,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}itsumo umaku ienai no wa nande darou?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.23,0:21:00.94,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}so why can't I say them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.31,0:20:57.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But...{es ist zu kurz fuer vier woerter}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:03.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I wanted to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.69,0:21:07.91,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}nande darou?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.69,0:21:07.91,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Why can't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.07,0:21:06.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I decided to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:20.00,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}tatoe kimazuku natte shimatte mo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:20.00,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}"Even when communication breaks down
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.42,0:21:25.93,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}mata tsukurinaoseba ii hazu sa
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.42,0:21:25.93,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}we can always just start over
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:27.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And now, I think I've done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.93,0:21:31.06,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}nanimo hajimatteinai kara ne
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.93,0:21:31.06,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}and go back to step one,"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.18,0:21:33.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I did it by sharing this time with my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:36.69,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}mou hitori no boku ga iikikaseru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:36.69,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}come the words out of my mouth to reassure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:53.25,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}hiraku mae ni kotae awase
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:53.25,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Time is running out for me to find the right words—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.25,0:21:58.71,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}ookiku naru fumikiri no oto
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.25,0:21:58.71,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}the train is nearing the crossroads.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.71,0:22:04.21,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}sawagu sawagu mune no naka wo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.71,0:22:04.21,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}How will things between us turn out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.21,0:22:15.64,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}miseru koto ga dekiru no nara dou narundarou?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.21,0:22:15.64,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}once I show you everything inside my aching heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.98,0:22:28.99,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}okubyou dakedo samenai kokoro
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.98,0:22:28.99,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}My heart is dumb, but not weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:24.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's still too early to reminisce. {originally had "look back and reminisce}{glad you changed it}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.99,0:22:29.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We've only just started.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.41,0:22:38.04,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}norisugoshite kizukunda kyou mo mata
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.41,0:22:38.04,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}We couldn't get it right today, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.78,0:22:34.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There are still countless memories to be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.83,0:22:48.30,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}reeru wa kimi wo hakondeyuku kara
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.83,0:22:48.30,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}The rails carry you away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:56.64,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}itsumo onaji miakita kaerimichi
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:56.64,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}leaving me alone on our usual path.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.68,0:23:07.15,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}matometa kotoba tanjun na no ni na
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.68,0:23:07.15,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}The words I prepared for you are so simple,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.61,0:23:06.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,From now on out, we'll hold our heads high
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.57,0:23:08.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,and walk forward, one step at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.15,0:23:15.41,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}itsumo umaku ienai no wa nande darou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.15,0:23:15.41,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}so why can't I say them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.45,0:23:13.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Youth. A blue spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.41,0:23:22.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We'll ride forward, on the stormy wind coursing through our hearts. {the only thing I feel strongly about is keeping the word "ride" in that form}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.70,0:23:22.88,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}nande darou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.70,0:23:22.88,Blau ganz,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Why can't I?
